<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπήγνῡμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>transfix, fix on a spit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγῷ᾽ ἀναπηγνύασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					843
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>impale, crucify,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ἐπὶ τοῦ ξύλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					222
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σῶμα διὰ τριῶν σταυρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Art.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> intr. pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπέπηγα</span>
			<i>project sharply,</i> of headlands, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				3.23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
